rst 4 digits with solid black squares, preserve last 2 digits and hyphens/spaces.\",\n      \"description\": \"UK 6-digit bank sort code with conversational and line-wrap tolerance.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"classifier_id\": \"CLS-EXT-BANK-ACCT-001\",\n      \"name\": \"Bank Account Number\",\n      \"category\": \"PII.FINANCIAL.BANK_ACCOUNT_NUMBER\",\n      \"type\": \"regex\",\n      \"pattern\": \"(?i:\\\\b(?:Account[\\\\s\\\\n_-]*(?:Number|No|#)|Acct[\\\\s\\\\n_-]*(?:Number|No|#)|Bank[\\\\s\\\\n_-]*Acct|Direct Deposit Account)\\\\b(?:\\\\s+(?:is|was|:|=|#|-))?\\\\s*[:#=]?\\\\s*)([0-9]{8,17})\\\\b\",\n      \"confidence_threshold\": 0.85,\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"mask_token\": \"[BANK_ACCOUNT]\",\n      \"mask_strategy\": \"partial\",\n      \"partial_mask_description\": \"Preserve last 4 digits, mask earlier digits with solid black squares.\",\n      \"description\": \"Financial bank account or direct deposit account number with conversational tolerance.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"classifier_id\": \"CLS-EXT-UK-SPOKEN-DOB-001\",\n      \"name\": \"Date of Birth (Spoken & UK Format)\",\n      \"category\": \"PII.DEMOGRAPHIC.DATE_OF_BIRTH\",\n      \"type\": \"regex\",\n      \"pattern\": \"(?i:\\\\b(?:born(?:\\\\s+on)?(?:\\\\s+the)?|DOB|Date of Birth)\\\\s*[:=]?\\\\s*)(?:the\\\\s+)?(\\\\d{1,2}(?:st|nd|rd|th)?\\\\s+(?:of\\\\s+)?(?:January|February|March|April|May|June|July|August|September|October|November|December)[,\\\\s]+\\\\d{4})\\\\b|\\\\b(?i:(?:born(?:\\\\s+on)?|DOB|Date of Birth)\\\\s*[:=]?\\\\s*)(\\\\d{1,2}[/-]\\\\d{1,2}[/-]\\\\d{4})\\\\b\",\n      \"confidence_threshold\": 0.85,\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"mask_token\": \"[DATE_OF_BIRTH]\",\n      \"mask_strategy\": \"full\",\n      \"description\": \"UK format and spoken conversational dates of birth (e.g. 14th of July, 1974 or 14/07/1974).\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"classifier_id\": \"CLS-UK-POSTCODE-001\",\n      \"name\": \"UK Postal Code\",\n      \"category\": \"PII.LOCATION.UK_POSTCODE\",